    "복사됨" : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG enrollment test: the PSKd was copied",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copied"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copiado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "상대 기기가 이 EUI-64와 설정 코드의 보드임을 증명하지 못했습니다. 연결을 끊었습니다." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment failure: the board's proof did not verify",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The other device could not prove that it is the board with this EUI-64 and setup code. The connection was closed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El otro dispositivo no pudo demostrar que es la placa con este EUI-64 y este código de configuración. Se cerró la conexión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "선택한 보드가 광고하는 EUI-64가 확인한 값과 달라 연결하지 않았습니다. 목록에서 맞는 보드를 고르세요." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment failure: the picked row advertises another EUI-64",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The selected board advertises another EUI-64 than the one you confirmed, so no connection was made. Pick the right board in the list."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La placa seleccionada anuncia un EUI-64 distinto del que confirmaste, así que no se conectó. Elige la placa correcta en la lista."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "선택한 보드가 광고하는 EUI-64와 다릅니다. 목록에서 맞는 보드를 고르거나 값을 확인하세요." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment test: the entered EUI-64 differs from the picked row's advertised one",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This differs from the EUI-64 the selected board advertises. Pick the right board in the list or check the value."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No coincide con el EUI-64 que anuncia la placa seleccionada. Elige la placa correcta en la lista o comprueba el valor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "선택한 보드를 더 이상 찾을 수 없습니다. 다시 검색하세요." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment failure: the picked board is unknown",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The selected board can no longer be found. Search again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ya no se encuentra la placa seleccionada. Busca de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "선택한 허브의 주소를 아직 모릅니다. 허브를 찾은 뒤 다시 시도하세요." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG enrollment test: the picked hub has no address",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The chosen hub's address isn't known yet. Find the hub, then try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
