            "value" : "Aún no se conoce la dirección del hub elegido. Busca el hub y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "설정 코드 (26자)" : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment test: setup code field label",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setup code (26 characters)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Código de configuración (26 caracteres)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "설정 코드 형식이 올바르지 않아 아무것도 보내지 않았습니다. A–Z와 2–7로 된 26자여야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment failure: malformed setup code",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The setup code is malformed, so nothing was sent. It must be 26 characters of A–Z and 2–7."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El código de configuración no tiene un formato válido, así que no se envió nada. Debe tener 26 caracteres de A–Z y 2–7."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "설정 코드는 A–Z와 2–7로 된 26자입니다. 지금 %lld자가 입력되었거나 쓸 수 없는 문자가 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment test: setup code validation; the argument is the number of characters typed",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A setup code is 26 characters of A–Z and 2–7. %lld characters have been entered, or there is a character that can't be used."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un código de configuración tiene 26 caracteres de A–Z y 2–7. Se han introducido %lld caracteres, o hay un carácter que no se puede usar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "성공은 허브가 이 세션에서 보드의 첫 신호(heartbeat)를 받았다고 답할 때만 표시합니다. 보드의 응답, Bluetooth 연결 종료, Thread 가입은 진행 상황일 뿐입니다. 센서 모듈이 없는 Power Base의 첫 신호는 센서가 정상이라는 뜻이 아닙니다." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG BLE enrollment test: what counts as success",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Success is shown only when the hub answers that it received the board's first signal (heartbeat) in this session. The board's answers, the Bluetooth connection ending and joining Thread are only progress. The first signal of a Power Base without sensor modules does not mean that any sensor works."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El éxito solo se muestra cuando el hub responde que recibió la primera señal (heartbeat) de la placa en esta sesión. Las respuestas de la placa, el fin de la conexión Bluetooth y la unión a Thread son solo progreso. La primera señal de un Power Base sin módulos de sensor no significa que algún sensor funcione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "세션 시작 뒤 Linux Bridge가 이 Power Base의 heartbeat를 받았습니다. 모듈과 센서가 동작하는지는 따로 확인해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "DEBUG enrollment state heartbeat_received, description",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After the session started, the Linux Bridge received a heartbeat from this Power Base. Whether its modules and sensors work must be checked separately."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después de iniciarse la sesión, el Linux Bridge recibió un heartbeat de esta Power Base. Hay que comprobar por separado si sus módulos y sensores funcionan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "세션 취소" : {
